3146:FreeRTOS/src/queue.c ****          * 'Restricted' in its name.  It is not part of the public API.  It is
3147:FreeRTOS/src/queue.c ****          * designed for use by kernel code, and has special calling requirements.
3148:FreeRTOS/src/queue.c ****          * It can result in vListInsert() being called on a list that can only
3149:FreeRTOS/src/queue.c ****          * possibly ever have one item in it, so the list will be fast, but even
3150:FreeRTOS/src/queue.c ****          * so it should be called with the scheduler locked and not from a critical
